    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fef60fc00d82c27",
      "translationZh": "我们的旗舰 AI 天气预报模型现在加入了实时卫星数据、每小时更新、更高分辨率、精准降水预报以及清洁能源变量。它现已集成到 Search、Gemini、Maps、Google Maps Platform 和 Cloud 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
